  "details": "Since we've been playing this game for so long, this loading music actually sounds a bit annoying.\n\nOr sometimes you're in a very quiet room AFK listening to your own music, when you switch to another world, and during this loading time, this unshutable loading concert mixes with your own music and attacks your ear.\n\nI know that turning off the UI sound turns off this loading music, which is fine with the UI sound turned off, but it also turns off notifications for friends, groups, and so on, which is very annoying.\n\nSo I hope VRChat official can add this improved function, I believe many people and I have the same idea.",
